    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-bffe03609f@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker (NYSE:SYK) announced today it has completed the acquisition of OrthoSpace, Ltd., a privately held company founded in 2009 and headquartered in Caesarea, Israel, in an all cash transaction for an upfront payment of $110 million and future milestone payments of up to an additional $110 million.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2019/Stryker-acquires-OrthoSpace-Ltd/default.aspx\">See full press release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
